{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19211","headline":"酬元九侍御赠璧竹鞭长句 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬元九侍御赠璧竹鞭长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧玉孤根生在林，美人相赠比双金。\n初开郢客缄封後，想见巴山冰雪深。\n多节本怀端直性，露青犹有岁寒心。\n何时策马同归去，关树扶疎敲镫吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}